      "item": "tribalpower:pulse_cairn",
      "text": [
        "A cairn of stones that holds a beat. It stores up to **4,000 Pulse** and drinks the surplus of nearby generators, up to **200 a second**. Bursty generators fill it; hungry machines draw on it steadily."
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Stacking",
      "text": [
        "Stack cairns in a column: each of the first **five** holds its own 4,000 Pulse. The sixth stone on a pile is just a stone.",
        "A cairn only pulls from **generators** within 8 blocks, never from another cairn. Machines within 8 blocks spend generators first, then cairns.",
        "A comparator against a cairn reads how full it is. A redstone signal stops it filling."
      ]
    },
